sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: AP2 failure: mandates_not_supported and fallback to a non-agentic flow
  accDescr: Sequence diagram: AP2 failure: mandates_not_supported and fallback to a non-agentic flow. 3 participants: User, Shopping Agent, and Merchant. 3 steps, 2 crossing a trust boundary. Based on ap2 v0.2 (2026-04-28). Step 1: Shopping Agent to Merchant: Present a Checkout Mandate. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 2: Merchant to Shopping Agent: Checkout Receipt: status Error, mandates_not_supported. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 3: Shopping Agent to User: Hand the checkout to the user.
  autonumber
  participant p_user as User
  participant p_sa as Shopping Agent
  participant p_merchant as Merchant
  p_sa->>p_merchant: Present a Checkout Mandate
  Note over p_sa,p_merchant: Crosses a trust boundary
  p_merchant-->>p_sa: Checkout Receipt: status Error, mandates_not_supported
  Note over p_merchant,p_sa: Crosses a trust boundary
  p_sa->>p_user: Hand the checkout to the user
